Instructions: Your task is to generate an executable method according to the provided example, where a dataset with rows containing two columns (id and name) is converted to a dictionary applying a conversion function to a particular column. The column to apply the function to is specified by its position (index) in the dataset. The resulting dictionary should have keys corresponding to the values of the id column and values corresponding to the converted values of the name column. All keys must be unique in the dictionary.

